	(text "Pmod 10BASE-T1S: IEEE 802.3cg 10BASE-T1S without a PHY chip (PCS / PMA / PLCA in the FPGA). Tang Primer 25K pmod0 (J6, bank 1) or Tang Nano 9K Pmod base Rev.C pmod0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.40 233.68 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid 4561caed-02fb-5805-bb1d-a43929bba1e3)
	)
	(text "TX: LVCMOS33 x2 -> 100R -> 220p (edge rate) -> TMUX1511 (TX_EN) -> 18R: 1.0 Vpp into 50R, ~10 ns, high-Z when idle and when unpowered. R3 / R4 bypass the switch (also remove C1 / C2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.40 237.49 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid 757673a9-bd45-571d-8e83-c781b3e4c18c)
	)
	(text "RX: comparator H (1/7) = v > +th, L (2/8) = v > -th, th = VTH - VB from PWM_TH (-176 ... +324 mV). Hysteresis (SR latch) and DME decoding in the FPGA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.40 241.30 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid b276db74-133c-59ed-9fe7-33eebb915d64)
	)
	(text "Line: ESD (transceiver side) -> 200 uH CMC -> 100 nF DC block -> J2. JP1: 100R end termination (fit at both ends of the segment). R23 / R24: common-mode termination (option). No PoDL."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.40 245.11 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid 445417c5-9c83-50e6-90af-da0949589ffd)
	)
